      "detail": "Seven dangerous leaf names at five validated sites emit same-MAIN NATIVE_MUTATION_BEGIN, preserving PTD116/LastError before original call. Entry is neither actual HRESULT nor mutation completion; normal replies include enforced restoration receipts. Reader/worker and original call arguments are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "item": "Normal recovery authority",
      "result": "Implemented, native GPU unqualified",
      "detail": "Exact fixed build allowlist, retained live process creation/TEB/Job identity; raw INPUT/graphics/reference/lock/state-block/gamma and display output associations; actual normal exit0/empty Job required. Same observer lifetime, LastInput, topology and exact post-value guards precede original-value writes; two final reads required."
    },
    {
      "item": "Distinct cursor baselines",
      "result": "Explicit",
      "detail": "Parent baseline is captured before visible window creation. INPUT_BASELINE is sampled after device creation but before original input setup. Owner cursor restoration is checked against that36-byte input baseline; final parent cursor is compared twice after window/process teardown. They are not asserted equal by construction."
    },
    {
      "item": "Containment-only restoration",
      "result": "Limited and separate",
      "detail": "Any exit code is allowed only after retained process signal and actual empty Job. Current nonbaseline values must match latest completed observations or a current native BEGIN input. No unknown shell/clip/work-area attribution; no normal resource success is manufactured. Only the untransmitted final intent with no native BEGIN may be ignored."
    },
    {
      "item": "Absolute deadline",
      "result": "Implemented and kernel-tested",
      "detail": "Versioned supervisor clamps its session to the shared monotonic absolute deadline. Runner reserves3 seconds for containment and clips restoration timeout to remaining budget; the dedicated absolute_deadline case terminated the worker before a longer relative lifetime."
    },
    {
      "item": "Native gate",
      "result": "Closed",
      "detail": "NATIVE_WINDOW_ADMISSION=False guards check_gate and run before any helper/window launch. No gate JSON can bypass the current hardcoded false guard."
